{"candidate_identity":"0466fcaec55cc016f828ae847a6376a0f9885320ef285e0fe8c84239be84fa7a","payload":{"contract":"translation_surface_screen_v1","entries":[{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d8b84a8247a4aadd166d422d3e4aea60c9fb58c68da17e4e6bef7217d6ac0bcc","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"03a3917750849b8e23c1e1a7df76f6c158eeedf449fbb939a9c96e37ecc7cea3","logical_entry_identity":"dd42a293adcad675fa261b920aa07b220fe617cadbed65636ee38db650fedc89","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#GOLD#Equilibrium#LAST#\nEquilibrium reflects your standing in the grand balance of nature and how easily you can access Wild Gifts.\nThe closer it is to 0 the more in-balance you are.\nBeing too far out of balance may cause your Wild Gifts to fail when called upon.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"#GOLD#失衡值#LAST#\n失衡值是你保持自然平衡的能力，决定了你使用野性系技能的难易程度。\n失衡值越接近于0你破坏自然平衡的量越少。\n当你的失衡值过高时，你使用野性系技能时可能会失败。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"72817bebe61c27d9bcdccbfc7686bb2dc954f3e29d45907cb9b3c839ca471adc","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0d9667a10f1e1790c034294724462f9df1c310a4e22f6ac91bc9a236f72af37a","logical_entry_identity":"b18d3e326cc65f8c88ff74d0601051a041b5659599e2622f4b4979f33525dbff","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Learn to harness the innate power of your race.","source_tag":"_t","target":"学会驾驭自身与生俱来的种族力量。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8d6c10759e610c820163cf755b43d8cf5a6f7c43bbb2da919593d70e92c12ceb","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"48aae8255430cbec0f5a1daa42fd5e308e6d573e35725077705ba1877b07a329","logical_entry_identity":"206a97001370867a52fb67fe29d510d0f62394eac1823a28c4f37d1063b56c5e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Impose your tyranny on the minds of those who fear you. When a foe gains a new fear, you have a %d%% chance to increase the duration of their heightened fear and one random existing fear effect by %d turns, to a maximum of 8 turns.\n\t\tAdditionally, you gain %d Mindpower and Physical power for 5 turns every time you apply a fear, stacking up to %d times.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"将你的专制施加于畏惧你的敌人的心智。当一个敌人获得一个新的恐惧效果时，你有 %d%% 的几率将其强化恐惧以及另一个随机的已有恐惧效果的持续时间延长 %d 回合，最多 8 回合。\n\t\t此外，每当你恐惧一个目标，你获得 %d 精神强度和物理强度，持续 5 回合，最多叠加 %d 层。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4fdf12e4c806091cfbb167d35724ba1d0e53f95f093c51457a1316793b9c0b14","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"572c58c872f929ec234bdc54c4845100793fb138f5433f0d5d2aef2956a9fe2e","logical_entry_identity":"45c26e02a14968b8a2a582f68b471e8aa9cc8ab43c93f91ef95a88b8beed4b6b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#GOLD#Inscriptions#LAST#\nThe people of Eyal have found a way to create herbal infusions and runes that can be inscribed on the skin of a creature.  More exotic types of inscriptions also exist.\nThose inscriptions give the bearer always-accessible powers that can be used an unlimited number of times.\nA simple regeneration infusion is the most common type of infusion, and the use of runes of various types is also common among arcane users.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"#GOLD#刻印#LAST#\n埃亚尔的人们找到了制作草药输液与符文、并将其纹刻在生物皮肤上的方法。此外，还存在一些更为奇异的刻印。\n刻印给被刻印者提供一些可以无限使用的特殊能力。\n通常人们会纹刻一种回复纹身，当然奥术施法者之中还有各种常见的符文。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9011a8fc970a5402662def5b0a41d2035167eee7d92704802ca3de6c64285175","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"61f7eafc43dc92a75f2b4945140e1f4505b866ddec7935048c8299dd6e4e218c","logical_entry_identity":"6b813f8a4c1ecd84bdc6dd164aada77d5bd62f4470dfc6cf361424fdcdd2fb92","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"%s (slimey)","source_tag":"tformat","target":"%s（黏滑）"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"43828e99786956a6719b8fc352d57be39229cdd66bf2c05e647b2f82987ae5ba","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6922be093e31cf070e61a5c387c249b877fbf9e0a077b796ac65c6cfc3b76aa9","logical_entry_identity":"cdef84e4b4dd7c04626de41dba0847864d5d2c8b2e6b02bb2b5ff6ed00d7795a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Experienced and completed all the dreams in the Dogroth Caldera.","source_tag":"_t","target":"经历并完成达格罗斯火山的全部梦境。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"022fc2174e3c1135d1f185427f119cfad345e1e115a7afdc85f38caa8462e6c6","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"906f23c3afd7a3ae847f86bb14e7e50aa97cdea8c96c3994fb266f1947cfcd1f","logical_entry_identity":"00d1dc4e53f635824cc4517d1f8aa7c6943decba70f026df0720bb5122aeda49","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Orcs have seen countless battles, and won many of them.\n\t\tYou revel in the defeat of your foes, gaining %d%% damage resistance for 2 turns each time you kill an enemy.\n\t\tThe resistance will scale with talent level and your Constitution.\n\t\tAdditionally, passively increase all damage penetration by %d%%.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"兽人经历过无数战斗，并赢得了其中许多场。\n\t\t每当你击杀一个敌人，都会因战胜对手而振奋，获得 %d%% 全伤害抗性，持续 2 回合。\n\t\t该抗性随技能等级和体质提高。\n\t\t此外，被动提高 %d%% 所有伤害穿透。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ab658f3561f954f74826b400174f43fc7fa6858680928157cbd6787f5cef8e0b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a3d9a14b7dfb300aec7c5f3b7076a38f0b7b8c7f647328e0a96b87c56b817f08","logical_entry_identity":"e5504acbbddf6ee2cf3ded1a7db03633f3502c71c3a259831b3a2ad58b1143f7","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Increases your Accuracy by %d, the damage multiplier of your striking talents (Pugilism and Finishing Moves) by %d%%, and reduces all damage taken by %d.\n\t\tThe offensive bonuses scale with your Dexterity and the damage reduction with your Strength.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"增加你 %d 命中。你攻击系技能（拳术、终结技）伤害增加 %d%% , 同时减少 %d 受到的伤害。\n\t\t攻击加成（命中与伤害）受敏捷加成，伤害减免受力量加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4e08bcbe3e38d75ebc9ec5848398f8bb9f9eddace2d90e3165595076163416e1","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"bd1f360973c3e5f1da153854039b10e34fa4c8aff119f0bcabb155c5bc4c6fab","logical_entry_identity":"0de3f76a674dd5a15522e560e79f9882fbf67a61d150b5bb7a7bfcbebcc1444e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"%s siphons space and time into %s %s!","source_tag":"logSeen","targ